And we will talk about the landscape
around whether or not Silicon Valley

00:34:01.900 --> 00:34:04.709
or New York, whether or not there
are specific cities that are ideal

00:34:04.710 --> 00:34:05.890
for certain types of pursuits.

00:34:05.890 --> 00:34:09.760
I think there was an article written by
Paul Graham some years ago, about the

00:34:09.809 --> 00:34:13.030
