so he would definitely agree with you.

01:25:52.740 --> 01:25:53.240
Marc Andreessen: Yeah.

01:25:53.630 --> 01:25:54.840
When their stocks crash,
they don't come back.

01:25:55.930 --> 01:25:58.380
And then Lysenkoism, like, the
