02:14:01.530 --> 02:14:01.950
Marc Andreessen: Yeah.

02:14:01.950 --> 02:14:04.620
So first I say we've got to separate the
real problems from the fake problems.

02:14:04.750 --> 02:14:05.540
And so there's a lot.

02:14:05.540 --> 02:14:07.840
A lot of the science fiction
scenarios I think are just not real.

02:14:07.870 --> 02:14:09.930
And the ones that you decided
as an example, like, it's.

02:14:09.930 --> 02:14:11.000
That's not what is going to happen.

02:14:11.000 --> 02:14:11.651
And I can explain why that's
not what's going to happen.

02:14:11.651 --> 02:14:16.250
There's a set of fake ones, and the
