02:14:28.190 --> 02:14:29.760
That's not how it works.

02:14:30.370 --> 02:14:33.770
And then there's also all these concerns,
destruction of society concerns.

02:14:33.809 --> 02:14:37.889
And this is misinformation, hate speech,
deepfakes, like all that stuff, which I

02:14:37.920 --> 02:14:40.079
don't think is actually a real problem.

02:14:40.510 --> 02:14:44.160
And then people have a bunch of economic
concerns around what's going to take all

02:14:44.160 --> 02:14:46.250
the jobs and all those kinds of things.

02:14:46.250 --> 02:14:47.040
We could talk about that.

02:14:47.040 --> 02:14:50.090
I don't think that's actually
the thing that happens.

02:14:50.550 --> 02:14:53.019
But then there are two actual
real concerns that I actually

02:14:53.020 --> 02:14:54.000
do very much agree with.

02:14:54.000 --> 02:14:57.529
And one of them is what you said,
which is bad people doing bad things.

02:14:57.559 --> 02:15:00.510
And there's a whole set of
things to be done inside there.

02:15:01.050 --> 02:15:03.755
The big one is we should use
AI to build defenses against

02:15:03.920 --> 02:15:05.560
all the bad things, right?

02:15:05.560 --> 02:15:08.290
And so, for example, there's a
concern AI is going to make it easier

02:15:08.480 --> 02:15:12.339
for bad people to build pathogens,
design pathogens in labs, which bad

02:15:12.340 --> 02:15:15.049
scientists can do today, but this is
going to make it easier, easier to do.

02:15:15.389 --> 02:15:17.709
Well, obviously, we should have the
equivalent of an Operation Warpspeed,

02:15:18.500 --> 02:15:20.610
operating in perpetuity anyway.

02:15:20.990 --> 02:15:23.730
But then we should use AI to
build much better bio defenses.

02:15:24.310 --> 02:15:27.680
And we should be using AI today to design,
like, for example, full spectrum vaccines

02:15:27.680 --> 02:15:28.730
against every possible form of pathogen.

02:15:30.490 --> 02:15:33.593
So defensive mechanism hacking,
you can use AI to build

02:15:33.740 --> 02:15:35.069
better defense tools, right?

02:15:35.069 --> 02:15:37.870
And so you should have a whole new
kind of security suite wrapped around

02:15:37.870 --> 02:15:40.410
you, wrapped around your data, wrapped
around your money, where you're having

02:15:41.200 --> 02:15:45.980
AI repel attacks, disinformation, hate
speech, deepfakes, all that stuff.

02:15:46.020 --> 02:15:49.970
You should have an AI filter when you
