02:15:49.970 --> 02:15:52.979
have to figure out whether it's really
me or whether it's a made up thing.

02:15:52.990 --> 02:15:55.010
You should have an AI assistant
that's doing that for you.

02:15:55.120 --> 02:15:55.420
Andrew Huberman: Oh, yeah.

02:15:55.420 --> 02:15:58.759
I mean, these little banners and cloaks
that you see on social media like

02:15:58.770 --> 02:16:00.460
"this has been deemed misinformation."

02:16:01.500 --> 02:16:04.689
If you're me, you always click because
