02:16:07.570 --> 02:16:11.370
I don't always look at this
image is gruesome type thing.

02:16:11.370 --> 02:16:12.900
Sometimes I just pass on that.

02:16:13.190 --> 02:16:17.580
But if it's something that seems
debatable, of course you look well.

02:16:17.580 --> 02:16:19.530
Marc Andreessen: And you should
have an AI assistant with you

02:16:19.530 --> 02:16:20.120
when you're on the Internet.

02:16:20.120 --> 02:16:22.740
And you should be able to tell that
